@@ -64,6 +64,18 @@ The message is for people; clients branch on `code`.
 `priority` is optional (`normal`). Answers 201 with the new ticket, whose status is `open`. The requester is notified
 that the ticket was received.
 
+### Import tickets: `POST /tickets/import`
+
+```json
+{ "tickets": [ { "title": "VPN drops every hour", "requester": "maria@example.com", "priority": "high" } ] }
+```
+
+Creates up to 5000 tickets, each given as `POST /tickets` takes it, in the order given. All of them are created or none:
+if an item is invalid the answer is 400 and its message names the first invalid item by its index in the array (`tickets[0]`
+is the first). Success answers 201 with `{ "created": 2, "ids": ["T-0043", "T-0044"] }`. Each ticket gets its audit entry
+(with the `X-Actor`) and its "received" notification, as when created one by one. The body may be larger than
+`MAX_BODY_BYTES` (up to 16 MiB).
+
 ### List tickets: `GET /tickets`
 
 | Parameter | Meaning |
